e fixed lifecycle boot observations independently corroborate the restart.","limitations":["The final lifecycle snapshot shows an additional nginx listener on TCP port 80, but the captured evidence does not show whether that port is admitted through firewalld; this limits assessment of its external exposure.","No external-host HTTP probe was captured, although a request to node1's assigned network address succeeded and the firewall rule for TCP 6700 was directly confirmed."]}
